<h1>New Push Key</h1>

<p>We'll send you a push key to the given email address. It expires in 24 hours and replaces an existing active key, if any.</p>

<p>You can use it to push gems like this:</p>

<pre>
  <code>GEM_HOST_API_KEY=push_key gem push --host <%= namespace_url("@") -%></code>
  <code>GEM_HOST_API_KEY=push_key RUBYGEMS_HOST=<%= namespace_url("@") -%> rake release</code>
</pre>

<hr>

<%= form_with url: user_push_keys_path do |form| %>
  <%= form.label :email_address %>
  <%= form.email_field :email_address, placeholder: "me@example.com" %>

  <%= form.button "Create push key" %>
<% end %>
